# ==========================================
# Lambda Calculus 範例與測試檔案
# ==========================================

# 1. 基本範例：Identity 函數與應用
(\x. x) y
(\x. \y. x) a b
(\x. \y. y) a b

# 2. 邱奇布林值 (Church Booleans) 定義
TRUE = \t. \f. t
FALSE = \t. \f. f

# 3. 邏輯運算定義
NOT = \p. \t. \f. p f t
AND = \p. \q. p q FALSE
OR = \p. \q. p TRUE q

# 4. 測試布林運算與邏輯化簡過程
NOT TRUE
NOT FALSE
AND TRUE FALSE
AND TRUE TRUE
OR FALSE TRUE
OR FALSE FALSE

# 5. 巢狀與組合子測試
(\x. x x) (\y. y)